Package: hydrateme
Version: 1.4.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-dbus, pulseaudio-utils, libnotify-bin, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libegl1, libgl1
Maintainer: Karan Kumar <karankumarsacher@gmail.com>
Description: Smart hydration reminder for Linux desktops
 HydrateMe is a lightweight desktop application that helps users
 build healthy hydration habits with customizable reminders.
 .
 Running quietly in the system tray, it delivers attention-grabbing
 notifications and reminder windows even while you are working.
 When your screen is locked or you are away, HydrateMe automatically
 switches to desktop notifications instead of interrupting your session.
 .
 Features:
  - Smart hydration reminders
  - System tray integration
  - Custom reminder intervals
  - GNOME screen lock detection
  - Native Linux desktop experience
  - Lightweight and low resource usage
